  "limitations": [
    "STD-089 retains two original strict-tolerance differences. Actual native K/RHS/high-precision displacement and independent operation-by-operation float32 recovery in native member-end order reproduce the endpoint output. Scoring v3 uses frozen strict tolerances; recovery-scale allowances are diagnostic only. Native values and all case files remain unchanged. The observed case replay does not prove a general vendor arithmetic bound or correctness for other model domains.",
    "Source-guided reviews and native provenance qualification do not satisfy independent blind-input reconstruction; inputReviewed=accepted=0.",
    "No candidate-model trial was run. Authorized isolated numeric PKPM/YJK solver jobs ran on <native-host> via codex_qsz; prompts, answers and grading rules stayed local, with no remote model requests or StructureClaw/data-factory changes. No solver job ran on <native-worker>.",
    "PKPM effective shear area has behavioral qualification within the tested frame domain, not direct native scalar As readback. Missing fixed-base SDK translations are explicit reviewed boundary derivations with raw sentinels retained. YJK effective stiffness and native serialization are retained separately from literal material fields.",
    "Approved planning projection retains an inherited capability registry digest mismatch; all task/model/workbook digests verify and a rebuild changes only that metadata digest."
  ],
